  <ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedAnnualEffectAndNatureOfAnyImportantWageScaleChangesTextBlock id="HHEBA1CD44839C108D1DAFD6DE3427BE45" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12.6px;"&gt;None&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedAnnualEffectAndNatureOfAnyImportantWageScaleChangesTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfStatusOfAnyMateriallyImportantLegalProceedingsTextBlock id="HH22FBAEA0509E80B804A4341B1670898A" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 14.9333px;"&gt;&amp;#160;On July 18, 2018, in Docket No. PL17-1-001, the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission (&amp;#8220;Commission&amp;#8221;) dismissed the requests for rehearing and clarification of its revised policy statement on treatment of income taxes &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 14.9333px;"&gt;(&amp;#8220;Revised Policy Statement&amp;#8221;) and provided guidance regarding the treatment of accumulated deferred income taxes (&amp;#8220;ADIT&amp;#8221;) in light of its revised policy.&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; font-style: italic; line-height: 14.9333px;"&gt;Inquiry Regarding the Commission&amp;#8217;s Policy for Recovery of Income Tax Costs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 14.9333px;"&gt;, Order on Rehearing of Revised Policy Statement, 164 FERC 61,030 (Jul. 18, 2018) (&amp;#8220;July 18 Order&amp;#8221;). Pursuant to the guidance provided by the Commission in its July 18 Order, Big Sandy Pipeline, LLC, an indirect wholly-owned subsidiary of (a tax pass-through entity owned in part by) Spectra Energy Partners, LP, a master limited partnership, intends to remove any balances recorded in Accounts 190, 281, 282, and 283 of the Commission&amp;#8217;s Uniform System of Accounts, as well as excess ADIT that has been transferred to Account 254 and deficient ADIT that has been transferred to Account 182.3. Big Sandy Pipeline, LLC has requested approval from the Chief Accountant of the Commission to implement the accounting entries necessary for removing these balances. Upon receipt of the Chief Accountant&amp;#8217;s approval, Big Sandy Pipeline, LLC will reflect the removal of these balances in the annual and quarterly financing reporting required by Part 260 of the Commission&amp;#8217;s regulations.On November 27, 2023, SEP, a subsidiary of Enbridge Inc., filed with the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission (FERC) in Docket No. AC18-220-000 a request on behalf of certain of SEP&amp;#8217;s pipeline and affiliates, including BSP, for a Motion for Action on its September 10, 2018 request for approval of accounting entries in this proceeding.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfStatusOfAnyMateriallyImportantLegalProceedingsTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfMateriallyImportantTransactionsOfTheRespondentNotDisclosedElsewhereTextBlock id="HH582A4E700260C05D782FA2D6F218758A" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12.6px;"&gt;None&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfMateriallyImportantTransactionsOfTheRespondentNotDisclosedElsewhereTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInOfficersDirectorsMajorSecurityHoldersAndVotingPowersOfTheRespondentTextBlock id="HHC9E9219375AC2F82A8CDFAF00D88FECC" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -0.5in; line-height: normal; margin: 0in 0in 0in 0.5in; text-align: left;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160; &amp;#160; &amp;#160; &amp;#160; &amp;#160; &amp;#160; Removals, effective 03/01/2025&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -0.5in; line-height: normal; margin: 0in 0in 0in 0.5in; text-align: left;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; Love, LaWonda C., Tax Officer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -0.5in; line-height: normal; margin: 0in 0in 0in 0.5in; text-align: left;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -0.5in; line-height: normal; margin: 0in 0in 0in 0.5in; text-align: left;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;strong&gt;Appointments, effective 03/01/2025&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -0.5in; line-height: normal; margin: 0in 0in 0in 0.5in; text-align: left;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; Villegas, Michael J., Tax Officer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -0.5in; line-height: normal; margin: 0in 0in 0in 0.5in; text-align: left;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -0.5in; line-height: normal; margin: 0in 0in 0in 0.5in; text-align: left;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;strong&gt;Removals, effective 11/01/2025&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
