    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH632CED8C3D01BCE47B09A91FB0E46CA3" xlink:label="HH632CED8C3D01BCE47B09A91FB0E46CA3" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHF2E770F5DBFB59AA9667CE5785F9A0D4" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <table style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;" border="1">
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td style="width: 99.863%;">Schedule Page 338 Colomn b&#160;</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="width: 99.863%;">All plant base amounts reported are ending balances.&#160;</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH632CED8C3D01BCE47B09A91FB0E46CA3" xlink:to="HHF2E770F5DBFB59AA9667CE5785F9A0D4" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH9BC7D5A92B59A328BEC0774C740FDFF5" xlink:label="HH9BC7D5A92B59A328BEC0774C740FDFF5" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH7CC23E210212D1621F5A64F412092010" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>All system balancing gas recorded under the fixed asset method as defined by FERC Order 581. System gas volumes needed for load balancing, no notice transportation and other operational purposes is recorded in account 117.2 (current portion). For purposes of accounting for encroachment resulting from line inventory changes, we used Account 117.4 with appropriate debits to Account 808.1 and credits to Account 808.2.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH9BC7D5A92B59A328BEC0774C740FDFF5" xlink:to="HH7CC23E210212D1621F5A64F412092010" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH78EE81FC632E03755F8A794F67879ABC" xlink:label="HH78EE81FC632E03755F8A794F67879ABC" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH8463AD6867D9539E5E9CC1958BFDF1EB" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Loss and Unaccounted For (LAUF).&#160; LAUF incurred in the operation of the pipeline is tracked and flowed through to customers.&#160; LAUF amounts are recorded as a debit to account 813-Other Gas Supply Expense and a credit to account 812-Gas used for Other Operations.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH78EE81FC632E03755F8A794F67879ABC" xlink:to="HH8463AD6867D9539E5E9CC1958BFDF1EB" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HHB0E0212D3EA89FAF48D6C46DFFCD0264" xlink:label="HHB0E0212D3EA89FAF48D6C46DFFCD0264" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH15B585A5723A073C252E9661D825487E" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Loss and Unaccounted For (LAUF).&#160; LAUF incurred in the operation of the pipeline is tracked and flowed through to customers.&#160; LAUF amounts are recorded as a debit to account 813-Other Gas Supply Expense and a credit to account 812-Gas used for Other Operations.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
