    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH24E97AC62F86DB95442B989A2C3CC859" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>ASC 980-710-25, "Accounting for the Effects of Certain Types of Regulation" contains discussion of the regulatory accounting implications of recording accrued vacation under ASC 710-10-25.</p>
