            <tr>
              <td style="width: 49.9315%; text-align: right;">Total</td>
              <td style="width: 49.9315%; text-align: right;">
                <strong>1,607,616</strong>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="width: 49.9315%; text-align: left;">Enbridge affiliates charge such expenses based on the cost of actual services provided or using various allocation methodologies based on our percentage of assets, employees, earnings, or other measures compared to other Enbridge affiliates.</td>
              <td style="width: 49.9315%; text-align: right;">&#160;</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
